    "nl": {
      "before": "Ed van de Gevel:\n“I am happy to publish another\nstudy by our Belgian friend Ignace\nVandecasteele. White must catch\nthe bs, stop the bp and improve the\nposition of his own knight. He man-\nges to do so”:",
